        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana UFBP4505, 1-5/8\" Fancy Floor Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's Solid Brass 1-5/8 Inch Fancy Universal Door Stop is simple enough to fit in to any decor but the ridged edge adds unexpected flair. Easy to install, it is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. Includes mounting hardware. This is one the quickest floor mounted door stops to install because the ring goes all the way around the bumper, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. Drill one hole and it's done. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the wall and door knob or lever as well.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFBP4505-specifications.gif?v=1704354590\" width\"469\" height=\"249\" border=\"0\" atl=\"1-5/8\" Fancy Floor Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-2-1-8-inch-fancy-universal-door-stop-deltana-ufbp5000\"><b>Tall Fancy Floor Door Stop</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-door-stop-ring-deltana-ufb4505rub\">Replacement Rubber Ring</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana UFBP4505 Decorative Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-5/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Height of Rubber from Floor: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Dark Gray</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hardware: #12 x 1-1/2\" screw plus plastic anchor.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/UFBP4505.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana UFBP4505 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 1-5/8 Inch Fancy Universal Door Stop",
                "description": "1-5/8 Inch Fancy Floor Door Stop, Deltana UFBP4505 - Deltana's Solid Brass 1-5/8 Inch Fancy Universal Door Stop is simple enough to fit in to any decor but the ridged edge adds unexpected flair. Easy to install, it is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. Includes mounting hardware. This is one the quickest floor mounted door stops to install because the ring goes all the way around the bumper, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. Drill one hole and it's done. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the wall and door knob or lever as well. Available in 9 beautiful finishes.",
